<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia Feb forex reserves fall $45.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Slovenia Feb forex reserves fall $45.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Slovenia reported the following economic details on Tuesday.</p>
<p>FOREIGN EXCHANGE RESERVES</p>
<p>    (in million of dollars)    Feb	Jan     Feb 96</p>
<p>    Total reserves		3,880.2  3,925.9  3,361.4</p>
<p>Bank of Slovenia reserves 2,431.8  2,239.1  1,602.9 NOTE: Total reserves are those held by the banking sector as whole. -- Marja Novak, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
